if (window.SpainGame) { window.SpainGame.oust(Q, false); }
!}

= Removed over the finances

With the party unable to pay its own campaign debts, the Federal Committee meets in emergency session. The regional leaders, the old guard and even some of your own executive vote to remove you for "the ruinous management of the party". A caretaker committee takes over Ferraz.

[? if leadership_exception_open = 1 : The members have not spoken yet. The next primary is due in May 2017. ?]

@cat_155_gov
title: Independence declared
new-page: true
tags: sp_event
view-if: catalan_crisis = 1 and cat_crisis_stage = 2 and time >= cat_stage_time + 1 and psoe_in_government = 1
on-arrival: {! Q.cat_crisis_stage = 3; !}

= Independence declared

The Parliament of Catalonia votes a declaration of independence. The decision is yours: as Prime Minister, only you can ask the Senate to authorise Article 155, and the PP's majority there will grant it. [? if depends_on_catalans = 1 : Your government survives on the votes of the very parties that have just declared independence. ?]

- @gov_155_elections: Apply Article 155 and call Catalan elections at once
- @gov_155_long: Apply Article 155 indefinitely, until order is restored
- @gov_no_155: Refuse Article 155: negotiate with the Generalitat

@gov_155_elections
