@fc_attack
title: Run attack ads

= Run attack ads

Each spend costs 1 in party funds. Attack ads drive a rival's voters to stay at home or look elsewhere; only some come to you. About one in five campaigns backfires.

- @fca_pp: Against the PP
- @fca_cs: Against Ciudadanos
- @fca_up: Against Podemos
- @fca_vox: Against Vox
- @fca_psoe: Against the PSOE
- @final_campaign: Back

